abstract: "Open-source code repository accompanying the Sequences to Success in
  Washington State project, a collaborative effort between MDRC and the Washington
  Student Achievement Council (WSAC). Provides a practical toolkit for researchers
  who want to apply sequence analysis and cluster analysis to state longitudinal
  administrative data to study postsecondary pathways."
